# Faerie Fencing with its only target gone doesn't resolve (CR 608.2b): Bot1 controls Faerie Mastermind as it casts Fencing with
# X = 0 at Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2) and, holding priority, Lightning Bolt at the same Ornithopter. The Bolt resolves first and
# kills it; Fencing has no legal target, does nothing and goes to Bot1's graveyard. Its -3/-3 goes nowhere else: Bot2's other
# creature, Concealing Curtains, stays 0/4.

